The [[Angry Snowman]] is located in the Secret Lair of the Snowmen dungeon. It drops a [[Dungeon Key]], and killing it disables the nearby traps.  Unlike the other snowmen in this dungeon, the Angry Snowman is not [[fleshy]].

==Locations==
*[[Depths of Tyria]]
**{{NPC location|Secret Lair of the Snowmen}}

==Skills==
18 [[Water Magic]] in [[Hard Mode]].
*{{skill icon|Frozen Burst}}
*{{skill icon|Ice Prison}}
*{{skill icon|Ice Spikes}}
*{{skill icon|Ward Against Harm}} ([[elite]])
*{{skill icon|Ice Fort}}

==Items dropped==
*[[Dungeon Key]]
